# Bot2 casts Duress with its Swamp and keeps two Moxes untapped to pay Miscalculation's {2}, so Duress resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Miscalculation
4 Island
10 Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Duress
3 Swamp
10 Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Miscalculation.Cast(Duress)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.PayCost

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Miscalculation
Bot2.Graveyard = Duress
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = true
